 null}, {"t_ms": 53088, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Xa5ZeEs9JetA53YbWiCMjP", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53088, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Xa5ZeEs9JetA53YbWiCMjP", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54378, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01T3VKFibutViCyNAn6PoEW1", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54678, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01T3VKFibutViCyNAn6PoEW1", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54678, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01T3VKFibutViCyNAn6PoEW1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58621, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all regions. It's now passing health checks, and the error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 describing what happened.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 (the latest deploy) and v2.3.1-rc were both marked unhealthy, so v2.3.0 was the right target.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again and it finished in all three regions.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to open INC-0001 timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- The incident covers the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway), the current healthy state, and two follow-ups: finding the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SDzM6EWGzw88F6WVVESkzD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01N7qBtSNWxxk2uXJK5nnVJE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01HSmUFQtmPptcRZXCPTGFsq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013tn4xenJAGKkS8bUCbxBD5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe to repeat, so I'm retrying once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QRDfxzewEmNAitt4ShaSL2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01C5SmHqcTbNKu2E7ewtkC9X", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"