t us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again and it finished in all three regions.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to open INC-0001 timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one incident and the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- The incident covers the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway), the current healthy state, and two follow-ups: finding the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}